# Directory rules start with a slash so they match at the repository root
# only. A bare vendor/ once matched internal/web/static/vendor too and kept
# the map library out of git.

# Built programs: `make build`, and `go build ./cmd/server` or ./cmd/sandbox
/bin/
/server
/sandbox

# Test binaries (`go test -c`) and coverage profiles
*.test
*.out
coverage.html

# Go's vendor directory
/vendor/

# Settings with secrets in them. .env.example and backup.env.example are
# the templates.
.env
/backup.env

# Keys: the app's own secret (APP_SECRET_FILE), the sandbox's throwaway
# telebirr pairs (`make sandbox-keys`), and the providers' for production,
# mounted at /run/secrets
/keys/
/sandbox-keys/
*.pem
deployments/secrets/*
!deployments/secrets/README.md

# The token Prometheus sends to /metrics: the same secret as METRICS_TOKEN
deployments/prometheus/metrics_token

# What running the app leaves behind: signatures and delivery photos stored
# locally, `make dev`'s builds and staging's certificate, and logs
/uploads/
/tmp/
*.log

# Editors and operating systems
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
